TITLE Equilibrate with gas phase and report molalities
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    units mmol/kgw
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
    Aragonite 0 10
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 25
    -volume 1
    CO2(g) 0 1
    CH4(g) 0.69897 1
    H2S(g) 1 1
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -alkalinity true
END
